6-03-23T20:19:41Z","body":"🤖 **AI Work Session Started**\n\nStarting automated work session at 2026-03-23T20:19:39.423Z\n\nThe PR has been converted to draft mode while work is in progress.\n\n_This comment marks the beginning of an AI work session. Please wait for the session to finish, and provide your feedback._","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP/issues/comments/4113446621/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP/issues/comments/4113478214","html_url":"https://github.com/Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP/pull/1358#issuecomment-4113478214","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP/issues/1358","id":4113478214,"node_id":"IC_kwDOQ35BQ871LrJG","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-23T20:24:41Z","updated_at":"2026-03-23T20:24:41Z","body":"## 🔍 Root Cause Found (via game log analysis)\n\nThank you for the game log! It revealed the actual bug clearly.\n\n**What was happening:**\n\n```\n[Enemy7] Patrol point 0 at (1700, 870) unreachable (dist to navmesh: 1909.7), removed\n[Enemy7] Patrol point 1 at (1800, 870) unreachable (dist to navmesh: 1999.2), removed  \n[Enemy7] Patrol point 2 at (1600, 870) unreachable (dist to navmesh: 1821.2), removed\n```\n\nDistances of **1800–2000px** to the nearest navmesh point are physically impossible — patrol points are placed within the level. This means the navmesh had **0 polygons** when the check ran. `map_get_closest_point()` on an empty navmesh returns garbage positions, flagging all patrol points as unreachable.\n\n**Root cause:** Level scripts bake the navmesh asynchronously (`await get_tree().physics_frame` + `bake_from_source_geometry_data`), but enemies spawn before the bake finishes. The previous 1-frame delay was not enough — baking takes multiple frames.\n\n**Fix:** Added `NavigationServer2D.map_get_polygon_count(nav_map) == 0` guard. If the navmesh has no polygons yet, the snap is deferred to the next frame. Once baking completes and polygons exist, the snap runs correctly on the actual navmesh.\n\n**Path display** should also work correctly once enemies are actually navigating (the `EnemyPathMonitor` overlay only shows paths with 2+ points; empty paths from standing-still enemies produced nothing to draw).\n\nThe fix is in `scripts/objects/enemy.gd` (`_process_patrol()`), ~5 lines added.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP/issues/comments/4113478214/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP/issues/comments/4113481082","html_url":"https://github.com/Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP/pull/1358#issuecomment-4113481082","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jhon-Crow/godot-topdown-MVP/issues/1358","id":4113481082,"